&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About This Role &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a CMM Inspector on the Manufacturing team, you will own the dimensional inspection and qualification of tubes, weldments, and machined parts — running portable-arm and fixed CMM measurement, tactile probing and laser scanning, fixturing, and the first article inspection that qualifies every part against drawing. You&#39;ll be trusted to take parts from incoming inspection through qualification and own the outcome: accurate, repeatable, and on time. You will play a critical role in scaling General Matter&#39;s production capability as the company works to build a domestic supply of enriched uranium and secure America&#39;s energy future. The ideal candidate is hands-on, thrives in fast-paced environments, and takes pride in flawless execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
