&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work extended hours and weekends as necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commit to a 100% in office role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently a US Citizen with capability to obtain and maintain a US DOE-Q clearance&lt;/li&gt;
