&lt;li&gt;5+ years in professional settings working on electrical design projects, power distribution systems, switchgears, PUS’s, and/or generators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work extended hours and weekends as necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
