&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience with platforms such as NetSuite, SAP, Oracle, Microsoft Dynamics, Salesforce, Workday, ServiceNow, Coupa, Arena, or Teamcenter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience architecting a broad enterprise portfolio spanning ERP, MES, QMS, PLM/PDM, WMS, procurement, analytics, identity, and collaboration systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience with cloud platforms such as AWS including GovCloud, Azure, or Google Cloud, and with data warehousing, business intelligence, and analytics platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
