&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work extended hours and weekends as necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to come into our office every day. This role is 100% on site and in person.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently a US Citizen with capability to obtain and maintain a US Q clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
