&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Provide Tier 2 and Tier 3 support for Windows and Linux users across engineering and business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Administer and maintain Microsoft Intune for device configuration, patching, compliance, and endpoint security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Manage Azure / Entra ID identities, MFA, and conditional access policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Support user and group administration across Microsoft 365 services (Exchange, Teams, SharePoint).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Support and troubleshoot engineering software such as CAD, CAM, and CFD tools (SolidWorks, CATIA, ANSYS, Siemens NX, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
