&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience in manufacturing, engineering, or heavy industry settings.&lt;/li&gt;
