&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Support the development and implementation of strategies to obtain and maintain licenses for new and existing nuclear facilities and projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Perform technical evaluations under the guidance of senior engineers to help ensure compliance with applicable codes, standards, and regulations (e.g., 10 CFR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Help monitor changes to nuclear regulations and assess their impact on operations and licensing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Support safety analyses, environmental reports, and risk assessments to ensure regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Work on documentation and technical writing to support licensing submissions and regulatory correspondence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Collaborate with engineering, operations, legal, and environmental teams to help address licensing requirements and resolve regulatory issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Participate in inspections, audits, and regulatory meetings alongside senior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
