&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;General Matter is enriching uranium in America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to restore our country’s ability to make nuclear fuel. Our fuel will help power AI, manufacturing, and other critical industries. It will power our next generation of reactors. Ultimately, it will power our national ambitions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were incubated by Founders Fund, like Anduril and Palantir before us, and we are backed by top tier investors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our lean, world-class team of engineers and operators is applying a first-principles approach to solving the problem of nuclear fuel production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a mission-driven company with a culture of urgency, accountability and transparency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;496&quot; data-end=&quot;948&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Management Associate to work directly with department heads and senior leaders to help drive execution across the organization. This role sits within Strategic Operations, supporting leadership on a wide range of operational challenges — from coordinating complex initiatives and managing leadership workflows to helping solve problems related to budgeting, scheduling, resourcing, and supply chain execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;950&quot; data-end=&quot;1205&quot;&gt;You will operate as a hands-on partner to leaders, ensuring priorities move forward and critical work stays coordinated across teams. The role is intentionally broad and offers exposure to how leadership teams make decisions and run complex organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1207&quot; data-end=&quot;1418&quot;&gt;This position is ideal for high-slope early-career operators who want to develop strong operational judgment, gain exposure to leadership decision-making, and take ownership of important organizational work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1442&quot; data-end=&quot;1536&quot;&gt;Partner directly with department heads to help coordinate and execute leadership priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1539&quot; data-end=&quot;1662&quot;&gt;Manage complex workflows including scheduling, meeting preparation, and follow-ups to ensure leaders operate effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1665&quot; data-end=&quot;1793&quot;&gt;Support cross-functional initiatives by tracking progress, resolving coordination challenges, and ensuring teams stay aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1796&quot; data-end=&quot;1931&quot;&gt;Help leaders work through operational problems spanning budget, staffing, scheduling, procurement, and supply chain coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1934&quot; data-end=&quot;2017&quot;&gt;Prepare materials, analyses, and briefings to support leadership decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2020&quot; data-end=&quot;2116&quot;&gt;Identify operational bottlenecks and help improve internal processes as the organization scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2138&quot; data-end=&quot;2242&quot;&gt;2+ years of professional experience in roles requiring strong analytical and operational thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2245&quot; data-end=&quot;2321&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage complex projects, priorities, or workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2324&quot; data-end=&quot;2373&quot;&gt;Strong organizational and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2376&quot; data-end=&quot;2449&quot;&gt;Ability to operate in fast-paced environments with evolving priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2452&quot; data-end=&quot;2502&quot;&gt;High level of judgment, discretion, and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2945&quot; data-end=&quot;3023&quot;&gt;Cross-team initiatives stay coordinated and move forward despite complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3026&quot; data-end=&quot;3103&quot;&gt;Leadership meetings and planning sessions are well-prepared and productive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3106&quot; data-end=&quot;3169&quot;&gt;Operational challenges are surfaced early and resolved quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to work extended hours and weekends as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position is based in Los Angeles, CA and requires being onsite full-time – hybrid and remote work will not be considered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;General Matter is an Equal Opportunity Employer; employment with General Matter is governed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications and will not be influenced in any manner by race, color, religion, gender, national origin/ethnicity, veteran status, disability status, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, mental or physical disability or any other legally protected status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is $80,000–$140,000 annually.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation bands are determined by role, level, location, and alignment with market data. Individual level and base pay is determined on a case-by-case basis and may vary based on job-related skills, education, experience, and internal equity. Please note that the stated salary range is an estimate and may be adjusted based on market conditions, business needs, or other factors. In addition to base salary, for full-time hires, you may also be eligible for long-term incentives, in the form of stock options, and access to medical, vision &amp;amp; dental coverage as well as access to a 401(k) retirement plan.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;General Matter is enriching uranium in America.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to design, build, and operate the world’s lowest-cost enrichment services in the United States.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to restore America’s ability to produce nuclear fuel—fuel that will power AI, advanced manufacturing, critical industries, and the next generation of nuclear reactors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ultimately, our work will help power national ambitions and enable a high-energy society.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were incubated by Founders Fund, like Anduril and Palantir before us, and are backed by top-tier investors. Our lean, world-class team of engineers and operators is applying a first-principles approach to solving the problem of nuclear fuel production.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a mission-driven company with a culture of urgency, accountability, and transparency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help us build a high-energy society by making the cleanest, safest form of baseload energy the most affordable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Manufacturing Engineer, you will design, develop, and build manufacturing processes, tools and systems to take us from development phases to production. You will work with design engineers to ensure safety, performance, cost and manufacturability of parts, systems, and assemblies. You&#39;ll be hands-on assembling hardware and test stands, iterating quickly, and refining processes. You&#39;ll work within an interdisciplinary team ensuring highly reliable, manufacturable systems and making a key impact in driving the down the cost of enrichment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement scalable manufacturing processes to ensure reliable, safe systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with design engineers and make recommendation for improved manufacturability, performance, safety, and cost.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, assemble, and validate prototypes, test stands, and development units.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform root-cause analysis on test failures and develop hardware mitigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish manufacturing and quality practices that scale with the company and through production phases.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of exceptional ability (prior projects, portfolio of work, completed products, etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Mechanical Engineering, Manufacturing Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in manufacturing, development, or production engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in a 3D CAD package (such as Solidworks, CATIA, NX, etc.) and the ability to make manufacturing drawings using GD&amp;amp;T.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of engineering fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to perform trade studies and make clear recommendations using first principles and engineering fundamentals even with partial information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a fast-paced engineering environment or a highly technical role requiring a resourceful, entrepreneurial approach to complete tasks within tight timeframes or budget constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with hardware in early development phases that transition to production.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on skills such as machining, welding, and assembly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work extended hours and weekends as necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;General Matter is an Equal Opportunity Employer; employment with General Matter is governed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications and will not be influenced in any manner by race, color, religion, gender, national origin/ethnicity, veteran status, disability status, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, mental or physical disability or any other legally protected status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is &lt;strong&gt;$90,000–$175,000 &lt;/strong&gt;annually.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation bands are determined by role, level, location, and alignment with market data. Individual level and base pay is determined on a case-by-case basis and may vary based on job-related skills, education, experience, technical capabilities and internal equity. &lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Please note that the stated salary range is an estimate and may be adjusted based on market conditions, business needs, or other factors.&lt;/span&gt; In addition to base salary, for full-time hires, you may also be eligible for long-term incentives, in the form of stock options, and access to medical, vision &amp;amp; dental coverage as well as access to a 401(k) retirement plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the Company &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
