&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a detail-oriented Nuclear Safeguards and Materials Control &amp;amp; Accountability (MC&amp;amp;A) Analyst to join our team. In this critical role, you will ensure compliance with nuclear safeguards regulations, develop and implement MC&amp;amp;A programs, and support operations by maintaining accurate material control and inventory tracking at a nuclear fuel cycle facility&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
