&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own the onboarding and offboarding experience end-to-end, from offer acceptance through first-week ramp and, when needed, exit logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Administer employee benefits programs, including enrollment, changes, and day-to-day employee questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate, up-to-date employee records in our HRIS, ensuring data integrity across systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Plan and execute company events and culture initiatives, managing logistics from budget to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Serve as a first point of contact for employee questions, exercising sound judgment with confidential and sensitive information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Identify gaps in existing People Ops processes and build or improve them — this role has real latitude to fix what&#39;s broken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Support compliance-related recordkeeping and documentation as our team scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Recruiting, Finance, and department leads to keep People processes running smoothly amid multiple, competing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
