&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;1+ years of administrative experience, including internships or part-time work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proficiency with Microsoft Office/Microsoft 365 (Excel, Outlook, Word, PowerPoint)&lt;/li&gt;
