&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is &lt;strong&gt;$140,000-$200,000 &lt;/strong&gt;annually.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation bands are determined by role, level, location, and alignment with market data. Individual level and base pay is determined on a case-by-case basis and may vary based on job-related skills, education, experience, technical capabilities and internal equity. &lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Please note that the stated salary range is an estimate and may be adjusted based on market conditions, business needs, or other factors.&lt;/span&gt; In addition to base salary, for full-time hires, you may also be eligible for long-term incentives, in the form of stock options, and access to medical, vision &amp;amp; dental coverage as well as access to a 401(k) retirement plan.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the Company &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;General Matter is enriching uranium in America.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our goal is to design, build, and&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;the world’s lowest-cost enrichment services in the United States. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our mission is to restore America’s ability to produce nuclear fuel—fuel that will power AI, advanced manufacturing, critical industries, and the next generation of nuclear reactors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ultimately, our&amp;nbsp;work will help power national ambitions and enable a high-energy society.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We were incubated by Founders Fund, like Anduril and Palantir before us, and are backed by top-tier investors. Our lean, world-class team of engineers and operators is applying a first-principles approach to solving the problem of nuclear fuel production. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are a mission-driven company with a culture of urgency, accountability, and transparency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Help us build a high-energy society by making the cleanest, safest form of baseload energy the most affordable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About This Role &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Restoring domestic nuclear fuel production is a race against a real deadline to keep America&#39;s reactors running and its nuclear expansion on track. Our schedule is a mission-critical asset to close the nation&#39;s fuel supply gap and end reliance on foreign, state-controlled suppliers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As an experienced Scheduler at General Matter, you will play a key role in the planning, coordination, and delivery of the large-scale infrastructure that brings our enrichment facilities from concept through full-scale operations. You will develop and maintain the detailed, integrated project schedules that leadership and project teams rely on to make timely, informed decisions. You will work across the organization, from construction and site teams to design, procurement, regulatory affairs, and program management, to keep schedules accurate and aligned, with clear visibility on the critical path across every phase of the work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;fully logic-driven Critical Path Method (CPM) schedules in Oracle Primavera P6; perform critical-path analysis, forecasting, and what-if/scenario studies, and report results to leadership with clear recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Integrate design, procurement, manufacturing, construction, and non-construction milestones (regulatory, licensing, permitting) into the schedule so the critical path reflects the full set of program drivers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the Basis of Schedule and scheduling standards, systems (EPS, templates, activity coding), and benchmarks that standardize durations and keep site-level schedules consistent across projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead schedule risk assessment and mitigation planning when delays or risks are&amp;nbsp;identified.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Perform quality reviews of schedules produced by onsite/field schedulers, ensuring their site-level schedules roll up cleanly into the integrated plan, and track schedule performance with the project controls and finance teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Conduct site visits to&amp;nbsp;validate&amp;nbsp;progress and contractor performance against schedule, and provide schedule input for planning, contract negotiations, and leadership reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
