&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong communication&amp;nbsp;skills, with the ability to synthesize complex schedule data into clear, concise updates for stakeholders and leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[8]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
