&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW150368318 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150368318 BCX0&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Controls Software Engineer to design and implement the control and automation software stack for test stands and production systems. This role sits at the intersection of industrial automation and systems software engineering, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150368318 BCX0&quot;&gt;is responsible for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150368318 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;building reliable, maintainable, and safety-critical control systems spanning PLCs, SCADA/HMI, and supporting high-performance software services. The successful candidate will play&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150368318 BCX0&quot;&gt;a central role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150368318 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;in defining the architecture, implementation standards, and operational reliability of mission-critical automation systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW150368318 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design, implement, and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;PLC-based control systems for chemical processing equipment, test stands, and production systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop and integrate SCADA/HMI systems for monitoring, control, alarming, and operational visibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build supporting services and control infrastructure for high-reliability and performance-critical components.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Define and champion modern software engineering practices, control system architecture, coding standards, testing strategies, and&amp;nbsp;operational best&amp;nbsp;practices across the automation stack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Migrate and modernize existing PLC logic onto the in-house control software platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work closely with hardware, electrical, and process engineering teams to integrate sensors, actuators, and field devices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead debugging, root cause analysis, and reliability improvements across the full automation stack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree or higher in Computer Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Computer Science, or a related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
