&lt;li&gt;Build tools and applications that interface with hardware, instrumentation, controls, and data acquisition systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop software to automate testing, experiments, data collection, analysis, and engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with engineers across software, electrical, mechanical, controls, test, and other technical disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate engineering requirements into reliable, maintainable software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug problems across software and hardware boundaries and help identify root causes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop tests, monitoring, and tooling to improve software and system reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in design reviews, code reviews, testing, and technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of projects and drive them from initial concept through implementation and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn new technologies and technical domains quickly as project needs evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
