&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship or academic project experience related to industrial building design or heavy construction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to facility planning for infrastructure, advanced manufacturing, or power-intensive sites.&lt;/li&gt;
