&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Business Development Intern to support managing customer engagements, commercial operations, and strategic business development initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This role is responsible for helping keep commercial efforts organized and moving forward. You will help coordinate meetings, maintain customer and partner pipelines, track action items, prepare briefing materials, and support opportunities as they progress from initial conversations through contract execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You will work across business development, legal, engineering, finance, and executive leadership to support alignment on priorities and help keep critical commercial work on track. This role is ideal for someone who is highly organized, enjoys solving operational problems, and wants to explore a career in business development, commercial operations, or strategic partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
