&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Help manage meeting logistics, agendas, briefing materials, notes, and follow-up action items.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Assist in maintaining accurate records of customer interactions, opportunities, contract status, and business development activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Support internal reviews and approvals required to move commercial opportunities forward.&lt;/li&gt;
