&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Assist in tracking deliverables, deadlines, and commitments across multiple concurrent projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Coordinate with engineering, legal, finance, and operations teams to gather information needed for proposals, contracts, and customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Support efforts to improve internal processes, documentation, and organizational systems that enable commercial execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Assist with planning customer visits, industry conferences, and strategic meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Perform other operational and administrative tasks that help the business development organization execute efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
