&lt;li&gt;Support load calculations, equipment sizing, airflow, psychrometrics, and hydronic design layouts under senior engineer guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn to participate in system modeling and simulation using BIM workflows and performance tools such as IES.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Observe and help coordinate with architectural, nuclear experts, structural, and electrical teams to ensure design integration and constructability.&lt;/li&gt;
