&lt;li&gt;Contribute to design automation efforts using visual programming (Dynamo, Grasshopper) or coding (Python, C#).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate technical concepts clearly and effectively to multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
