&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Total Rewards Manager at General Matter, you&#39;ll build and own how we pay, reward, and take care of the people restoring America&#39;s nuclear fuel supply. You&#39;ll set up our compensation and benefits infrastructure and run it day to day, and continue to mature our compensation and benefits strategy, philosophy, and implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The problems here don&#39;t come with off-the-shelf answers. How do you benchmark roles that barely exist anywhere else in the country? How do you design one rewards system that works for both first-principles engineers and the plant operators and technicians who will run a nuclear facility around the clock? You&#39;ll frame the question, pull the data, build the model, and bring leadership a clear recommendation with the tradeoffs made explicit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work with a modern stack (Rippling, Carta, Pave) and you&#39;ll be expected to build your own tools with AI. This is a hands-on, strategic role working with partners across engineering, nuclear operations, infrastructure, construction, security, legal, finance and people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you seek high impact, want true ownership of a function, and are excited by fast-paced, intense, Skunkworks-style work, we encourage you to apply to join our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own market benchmarking: participate in and manage salary surveys and build defensible benchmarks for specialized roles with thin survey coverage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain compensation bands, leveling alignment, and guidance for offers, promotions, and market adjustments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct ongoing compensation analysis, including internal equity reviews, offer modeling, and cost projections, and turn the results into clear recommendations for leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run comp review cycles during performance season from start to finish, covering budget modeling, manager guidance, calibration support, and communicating outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Talent Acquisition on competitive offers, and with Finance on headcount and compensation budgeting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own our benefits programs end-to-end, including medical, dental, vision, 401(k), and wellness offerings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead annual benefits renewals: manage broker and carrier relationships, analyze plan performance and cost trends, and negotiate the best outcome for employees and the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Source, evaluate, and implement new benefits vendors as our needs evolve and our workforce grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and manage the benefits budget, forecasting costs and finding savings without giving up quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plan and run open enrollment, and make benefits easy for employees to understand and use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own pay transparency compliance across California and every other state where we hire, including posted salary ranges, pay data reporting, and recordkeeping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain compliance with applicable benefits regulations (ERISA, ACA, COBRA, HIPAA) in partnership with brokers, administrators, and counsel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Treat all compensation and employee data with strict confidentiality and judgment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Tooling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Administer and optimize our Total Rewards stack (Rippling, Carta, Pave) so the data is clean, connected, and trustworthy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use AI to build tools that make Total Rewards faster and smarter, such as comp calculators, offer modeling tools, cycle workflows, and dashboards for leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Write clear documentation and guidance so managers and employees understand how and why we pay the way we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evidence of exceptional ability, such as rewards programs you&#39;ve built, models or tools you&#39;ve created, or problems you&#39;ve solved that had no playbook.&lt;/p&gt;
